ion references needed to operate the platform."}]]}],["$","section","How information is used",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-[#17243a]","children":"How information is used"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Information supports authentication, expert verification, matching, quoting, payment status, dispute resolution, fraud prevention and required service notifications."}]]}],["$","section","Sensitive documents",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-[#17243a]","children":"Sensitive documents"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Identity, tax and professional documents are treated as sensitive. Access is restricted to administrators with explicit document-view permissions and files are stored privately."}]]}],["$","section","Payments",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-[#17243a]","children":"Payments"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Raw mobile-money credentials are not stored by KaziLedger. Payment processing and status verification are handled through Pesapal using provider transaction references."}]]}],["$","section","Your choices",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-[#17243a]","children":"Your choices"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600","children":"Marketing messages require opt-in consent. Transactional notices necessary to deliver a requested service may still be sent. Contact support@kaziledger.example for privacy requests."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
